The '''Spring Shallows''' is a [[Location]] found within the {{Zone|Torrhus Springs}} on the {{zone|Torrhus Canyon}}. 

{{ZoneText|Gather more &aSea Lumies&f.|Use your &9Fishing Net &fto &eHunt&f.|Swim down deeper into the &9Spring Depths&f.}}
== Features ==
The '''Spring Shallows''' represents the top portion of the tall body of water that makes up the {{Zone|Torrhus Springs}}. Within it, players can find {{MobSprite|Solar}}s, which can be [[Hunting|hunted]] using a [[Fishing Net]].

Players can swim down further into the water to access the {{Zone|Spring Depths}}.

